error[E0140]: `W.to_string` instantiates itself without end
  --> E0140-print-grows-enum.sisu:11:9
   |
11 |         print(Hold.Has(W(x: [self.x])))
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `print` here
   |
   = help: `print` is a call through `Display`, and a call through `Display` counts as reaching every conformance to `Display`. `Hold<W<[T]>>` holds `W<[T]>`, whose argument grows

